Bug 2076486 - Show the current state as check marks in the compose, mail and view source menus. r=mkmelin

Since bug 2010038 menu items no longer take their checked state from their
command. Set it on the menu items instead: Save As, Zoom Text Only and Wrap
Long Lines where the state is already known, and Attach vCard, Attach OpenPGP
key and Remind Me Later from their command when the attach menus open.
Starred in the Mark toolbar popup is set like the one in the menu. Customize
From Address no longer checks itself when clicked, so cancelling it leaves
the check mark alone.

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329884

